      "qid": "i_feel_bored",
      "notice_cond": "noov",
      "response": "It's common to feel bored sometimes. Why not set small prompts or challenges for yourself, even as simple as trying a new hobby or trying out a singer to see how you like his or her music? Those activities can keep your mind engaged. Sometimes a switch even if it\u2019s small might help! Encourage yourself to mix things up whenever you feel bored.",
